@startuml
title Sequence Diagram M04 - Staf Memperbarui Status Pesanan

actor "Staf Laundry" as Staf
participant "Antarmuka Lavora" as UI
participant "M04 Laundry Status Tracking" as M04
participant "M01 Authentication & Access Control" as M01
participant "M02 Order Management" as M02
participant "M06 Customer Notification" as M06

Staf -> UI : Pilih pesanan dan status baru
UI -> M04 : perbaruiStatus(orderId, statusBaru)
M04 -> M01 : verifikasiHakAkses(sesi)
M01 --> M04 : akses valid
M04 -> M02 : ambilPesanan(orderId)
M02 --> M04 : data pesanan dan status saat ini
M04 -> M04 : validasiUrutanStatus

alt urutan status valid
    M04 -> M04 : simpanStatus dan catatRiwayat
    M04 -> M06 : buatNotifikasi(orderId, statusBaru)
    M06 --> M04 : notifikasi dibuat
    M04 --> UI : status berhasil diperbarui
    UI --> Staf : tampilkan konfirmasi
else urutan status tidak valid
    M04 --> UI : perubahan ditolak
    UI --> Staf : tampilkan pesan error
end
@enduml
